      "content": "thanks for the tip on the temp, i'll try lowering it to the 300s and see if that helps the etching. about the humidity though—is it really possible for it to just wipe out the pigment like that? it's not just a little fade, it's like entire sections of the design are just totally absent from the fabric even though the paper looks perfect. it's super frustrating, feels like the color is just disappearing into thin air during the press.",
